<title>SWEDEN: Swedish sharemarket hits all-time high.</title>
<headline>Swedish sharemarket hits all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish sharemarket closed on Monday at an all-time high after climbing 0.83 percent during the day's trade to 2,016.84.  </p>
<p>The index toppled a previous record set on Friday when it closed at 2,000.21.</p>
<p>Turnover during the day was slightly higher than above average at 3.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
